{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 6415156378063158247,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "TCP Implementation",
      "source_hash": 7994942702950286366,
      "context_hash": 17975664090044432075,
      "translation": "TCP 구현",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "TCP": "TCP"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:46.466461Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "How the kernel implements reliable, ordered, byte-stream delivery",
      "source_hash": 14226314177409676779,
      "context_hash": 11756855914995467724,
      "translation": "커널이 신뢰성 있고 순서가 보장되는 바이트 스트림 전달을 구현하는 방법",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "byte": "바이트",
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:46.466462Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "TCP's guarantees",
      "source_hash": 14612584435743948925,
      "context_hash": 4469397671184910120,
      "translation": "TCP의 보장 사항",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "TCP": "TCP"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:46.466462Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "TCP provides:",
      "source_hash": 6949219013928158969,
      "context_hash": 161701994830513648,
      "translation": "TCP는 다음을 제공합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "TCP": "TCP"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:46.466462Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "**Reliability**: Lost packets are retransmitted",
      "source_hash": 16780078532608912554,
      "context_hash": 15159535299161821335,
      "translation": "**신뢰성**: 손실된 패킷은 재전송됩니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:46.466462Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "**Ordering**: Out-of-order segments are reordered before delivery",
      "source_hash": 16224804899261882458,
      "context_hash": 7747659513281093210,
      "translation": "**순서 보장**: 순서가 뒤바뀐 세그먼트는 전달 전에 재정렬됩니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:46.466462Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "**Flow control**: The sender doesn't overwhelm the receiver",
      "source_hash": 17995927544124284276,
      "context_hash": 15326706828054721234,
      "translation": "**흐름 제어**: 송신자가 수신자를 압도하지 않습니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:46.466462Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "**Congestion control**: The sender doesn't overwhelm the network",
      "source_hash": 5029867248563481659,
      "context_hash": 2294647738897734367,
      "translation": "**혼잡 제어**: 송신자가 네트워크를 압도하지 않습니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:46.466462Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "The kernel implements all four simultaneously, which is why TCP is complex.",
      "source_hash": 12915138533647693242,
      "context_hash": 5705102238430442435,
      "translation": "커널은 이 네 가지를 동시에 구현하며, 이 때문에 TCP가 복잡합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "TCP": "TCP",
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:46.466462Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "struct tcp_sock",
      "source_hash": 15371436089323687226,
      "context_hash": 13870943760242738600,
      "translation": "struct tcp_sock",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:46.466462Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "TCP state per connection is in `struct tcp_sock` (extends `struct sock`):",
      "source_hash": 8876916032605509823,
      "context_hash": 3505500587532340246,
      "translation": "연결별 TCP 상태는 `struct tcp_sock`(`struct sock`을 확장)에 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "TCP": "TCP"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:46.466462Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Sequence numbers and windows",
      "source_hash": 18395596123857014658,
      "context_hash": 9128465676560050519,
      "translation": "시퀀스 번호와 윈도우",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:46.466463Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Retransmission: RTO and timer",
      "source_hash": 16395773301493742069,
      "context_hash": 6583989118901968956,
      "translation": "재전송: RTO와 타이머",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "timer": "타이머"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:46.466463Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The **Retransmission Timeout (RTO)** is calculated from RTT measurements:",
      "source_hash": 8217708263813894138,
      "context_hash": 14028461188338162445,
      "translation": "**재전송 타임아웃**(Retransmission Timeout, RTO)은 RTT 측정값으로부터 계산됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:46.466463Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "When a segment is transmitted, a retransmit timer is armed for RTO.",
      "source_hash": 14407573733887093949,
      "context_hash": 17987726410661645593,
      "translation": "세그먼트가 전송되면 RTO 시간으로 재전송 타이머가 설정됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "timer": "타이머"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:46.466463Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "If no ACK arrives within RTO:",
      "source_hash": 14633017539154142568,
      "context_hash": 15990792030574286574,
      "translation": "RTO 안에 ACK가 도착하지 않으면 다음이 일어납니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:46.466463Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "The segment is retransmitted",
      "source_hash": 14985482029836133344,
      "context_hash": 6056772810740886311,
      "translation": "세그먼트가 재전송됩니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:46.466463Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "RTO doubles (exponential backoff)",
      "source_hash": 7847132911367916912,
      "context_hash": 16711890895608887217,
      "translation": "RTO가 두 배로 늘어납니다(지수 백오프)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:46.466463Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "`snd_cwnd` is reduced (congestion signal)",
      "source_hash": 7182038801607876291,
      "context_hash": 33496189966099847,
      "translation": "`snd_cwnd`가 줄어듭니다(혼잡 신호)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:46.466463Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Fast retransmit and SACK",
      "source_hash": 10239538844230180135,
      "context_hash": 11677857542307337792,
      "translation": "빠른 재전송과 SACK",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "SACK": "SACK"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:46.466463Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "When out-of-order segments arrive, the receiver sends **duplicate ACKs** (same `ack_seq` as before, with a SACK block noting what was received).",
      "source_hash": 15996132360803490001,
      "context_hash": 2137488403895236912,
      "translation": "순서가 뒤바뀐 세그먼트가 도착하면 수신자는 **중복 ACK**(이전과 같은 `ack_seq`에, 수신한 내용을 알리는 SACK 블록을 덧붙인 것)를 보냅니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "SACK": "SACK"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:46.466463Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Three duplicate ACKs → fast retransmit (before RTO expires):",
      "source_hash": 10445115702482302862,
      "context_hash": 12796620329381260567,
      "translation": "중복 ACK 세 개 → 빠른 재전송(RTO 만료 전):",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:46.466463Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "With **SACK (Selective ACK)**, the receiver tells the sender exactly which segments were received out of order.",
      "source_hash": 3659003059907509837,
      "context_hash": 3889788775883533494,
      "translation": "**SACK**(Selective ACK)를 사용하면 수신자는 어떤 세그먼트가 순서가 뒤바뀐 채 수신되었는지 송신자에게 정확히 알려 줍니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "SACK": "SACK"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:46.466463Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "The sender can retransmit only the gaps:",
      "source_hash": 2818390065992827523,
      "context_hash": 9480157744440080834,
      "translation": "송신자는 빠진 부분만 재전송할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:46.466463Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Congestion control framework",
      "source_hash": 13746210788336491646,
      "context_hash": 12888481098531421014,
      "translation": "혼잡 제어 프레임워크",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:46.466463Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The kernel has a pluggable congestion control framework:",
      "source_hash": 3346017265596233557,
      "context_hash": 17651249001204980602,
      "translation": "커널에는 플러그인 방식의 혼잡 제어 프레임워크가 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:46.466463Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Available algorithms",
      "source_hash": 655532615720406196,
      "context_hash": 15633485410945128583,
      "translation": "사용 가능한 알고리즘",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:46.466463Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "CUBIC (default)",
      "source_hash": 14179566239091079194,
      "context_hash": 5388688759560000216,
      "translation": "CUBIC(기본값)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:46.466464Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "CUBIC uses the cubic function of time since last congestion event to grow the congestion window:",
      "source_hash": 15465375600390963129,
      "context_hash": 14658465982998534235,
      "translation": "CUBIC은 마지막 혼잡 이벤트 이후 경과한 시간의 3차 함수를 사용해 혼잡 윈도우를 키웁니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "function": "함수"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:46.466464Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "**Slow start**: cwnd grows exponentially until ssthresh",
      "source_hash": 4500227380566297656,
      "context_hash": 10869132959455140009,
      "translation": "**슬로 스타트**: cwnd가 ssthresh에 이를 때까지 지수적으로 증가합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:46.466464Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "**Congestion avoidance**: cwnd grows per the cubic function",
      "source_hash": 4351275767514261641,
      "context_hash": 15729044539750414889,
      "translation": "**혼잡 회피**: cwnd가 3차 함수에 따라 증가합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "function": "함수"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:46.466464Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "**Loss detected**: ssthresh = 0.7 × cwnd; cwnd = ssthresh",
      "source_hash": 17558570975467590429,
      "context_hash": 15034836844821831638,
      "translation": "**손실 감지**: ssthresh = 0.7 × cwnd; cwnd = ssthresh",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:46.466464Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "BBR (Bottleneck Bandwidth and RTT)",
      "source_hash": 9052375517185887016,
      "context_hash": 5244596119830125340,
      "translation": "BBR (Bottleneck Bandwidth and RTT)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:09:16.482245Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "BBR (Bottleneck Bandwidth and RTT) models the network path — bandwidth and propagation delay — rather than reacting to loss:",
      "source_hash": 15696319909527444644,
      "context_hash": 8652570693136467481,
      "translation": "BBR(Bottleneck Bandwidth and RTT)은 손실에 반응하는 대신 네트워크 경로, 즉 대역폭과 전파 지연을 모델링합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "bandwidth": "대역폭"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:09:16.482246Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:14/seg:0",
      "source": "BBR sends at a **paced rate** matching the bottleneck bandwidth, avoiding buffer bloat that loss-based algorithms create:",
      "source_hash": 16980974896951944786,
      "context_hash": 5782976979257635895,
      "translation": "BBR은 병목 대역폭에 맞춘 **페이싱 속도**(paced rate)로 전송하여, 손실 기반 알고리즘이 만들어 내는 버퍼 블로트(buffer bloat)를 피합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "bandwidth": "대역폭"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:09:16.482246Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Flow control: receive window",
      "source_hash": 17657912488003702434,
      "context_hash": 2154417601953132370,
      "translation": "흐름 제어: 수신 윈도",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:09:16.482247Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The receiver's `rcv_wnd` tells the sender how much space remains in the receive buffer.",
      "source_hash": 14595458065933725837,
      "context_hash": 7310691602626640393,
      "translation": "수신 측의 `rcv_wnd`는 수신 버퍼에 남은 공간이 얼마인지 송신 측에 알려 줍니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:09:16.482247Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "If `rcv_wnd = 0`, the sender stops (zero window probe situation):",
      "source_hash": 6324979860205526193,
      "context_hash": 16921374674194471642,
      "translation": "`rcv_wnd = 0`이면 송신 측은 전송을 멈춥니다(제로 윈도 프로브 상황):",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:09:16.482247Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "**TCP window scaling** (RFC 1323) allows windows > 65535 bytes by using a shift factor negotiated in SYN/SYN-ACK:",
      "source_hash": 17810676836179959744,
      "context_hash": 15871193360927399013,
      "translation": "**TCP 윈도 스케일링**(RFC 1323)은 SYN/SYN-ACK에서 협상한 시프트 계수를 사용하여 65535바이트보다 큰 윈도를 허용합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "RFC": "RFC",
        "TCP": "TCP",
        "byte": "바이트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:09:16.482247Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Nagle algorithm and TCP_NODELAY",
      "source_hash": 6371774944772213410,
      "context_hash": 8099601528987128077,
      "translation": "Nagle 알고리즘과 TCP_NODELAY",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:09:16.482247Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "By default, TCP delays small packets hoping to coalesce them (Nagle's algorithm).",
      "source_hash": 10144536861268203586,
      "context_hash": 9607194598880592229,
      "translation": "기본적으로 TCP는 작은 패킷들을 합치기 위해 전송을 지연합니다(Nagle 알고리즘).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "TCP": "TCP"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:09:16.482247Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "For latency-sensitive applications:",
      "source_hash": 10950655503607658420,
      "context_hash": 441606507097465045,
      "translation": "지연 시간에 민감한 애플리케이션의 경우:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "latency": "지연 시간"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:09:16.482248Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Key TCP sysctls",
      "source_hash": 10874718853480243002,
      "context_hash": 3510520515862562362,
      "translation": "주요 TCP sysctl",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "TCP": "TCP",
        "sysctl": "sysctl"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:09:16.482248Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:10/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Inspecting TCP connections",
      "source_hash": 9715635976319370255,
      "context_hash": 7736110728246128091,
      "translation": "TCP 연결 살펴보기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "TCP": "TCP"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:09:16.482248Z",
      "issues": []
